{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105246","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105246/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105246/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105246/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105246","id":2986203839,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6SIQGm","number":105246,"title":"De-duplicate a lot of `variant_internal.h`","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-04-10T16:16:24Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T02:57:27Z","closed_at":"2025-09-19T02:10:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105246","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105246","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105246.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105246.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"`variant_internal.h` (and similar headers) are currently a big old mess of duplicated logic.\r\n\r\nThis PR is a first step towards de-duplication.\r\nAs a codestyle PR, it should not affect performance (and probably won't have noticeable impact on compile time either).\r\n\r\n## Explanation\r\n\r\nIn practice, I see the following types / use-cases:\r\n- `VariantGetInternalPtr`: For types that are stored in `Variant`, get a pointer to their value.\r\n    - Some are stored behind additional logic, e.g. pooling or reference counts, indicated by `is_local`.\r\n- `VariantImplicitConvert` (new): For types that are not stored directly in `Variant`, but act as if they are, using another type as storage surrogate (e.g. `float` or enums).\r\n- `VariantInternalAccessor`: Offers an API to get or set any type that can be stored in `Variant` (both direct types and implicit conversion types).\r\n\r\nUsing this logic, structs can be simplified:\r\n- `VariantGetInternalPtr` has only 3 logical implementations (ignoring `Object`): Those that are stored in the `Variant`, those that use a pointer to a heap value, and those that use `PackedArrayRef`. This can be abstracted and de-duplicated.\r\n- `VariantInitializer` and `VariantDefaultInitializer ` for `is_local` types can just assign to the payload.\r\n- `VariantInternalAccessor` for stored types can access the stored type by reference, and for conversion types can return and accept copies.\r\n\r\n## Other changes\r\n\r\nTighter requirements on the declared types allowed me to spot a few accessor mistakes in the codebase, which I addressed.\r\n\r\n## Addendum\r\n\r\nIn follow up PRs, more duplicated logic should be removed from these headers, and duplicated functions and structs should be phased out. This is merely a first step establishing a way forward.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105246/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105246/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}